  "what_the_controls_mean": "constant_baseline is the no-vision predictor: the train-set mean layout, scored the same way -- a model that does not beat it has learned nothing from pixels. shuffled_labels_val re-scores the SAME predictions against permuted labels; pairing two independent draws it lands at or above the constant baseline, and if it ever landed near the model's own error the metric would not be reading the image at all.",
